  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 380
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 连盛平躯体内的两个元神争执起来，你时而听见魔修的咆哮，时而听见岛主的低吟，样子诡怪至极。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
